{"n":108,"videoId":"4kQZMw-7uWY","question":"What Do You Do On A Rainy Day?","method":"premiere","answers":[{"t":8.93,"dur":5.09,"text":"Waiting for passengers Passangers [should wear a] seatbelt","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":14.01,"dur":2.21,"text":"Watching Netflix and...","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.23,"dur":1.58,"text":"drinking alcohol maybe","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":18.81,"dur":2.55,"text":"[biking]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":21.36,"dur":2.59,"text":"well just last night I just lounged on my bed","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":23.94,"dur":2.46,"text":"Play some music Play with my dog","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":26.4,"dur":2.42,"text":"[Play chess]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":28.82,"dur":2.29,"text":"Stay at home","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":31.11,"dur":5.0,"text":"finding something to eat Because we have no work it’s raining, we can’t work outside","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":36.12,"dur":3.3,"text":"[take photos]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":39.41,"dur":4.0,"text":"Taking a bath and roaming around just for happiness","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":43.42,"dur":5.71,"text":"Probably... I'm on work -If you are not working, what do you do?","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":49.13,"dur":12.26,"text":"Just swiping, to find some... other work Like applying for other work or a better compensation","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":63.56,"dur":2.84,"text":"[fixing things]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":66.4,"dur":6.17,"text":"Just like now. It's very rainy. there's a typhoon it's just hitting our country","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":72.57,"dur":4.34,"text":"So we do some flood monitoring on the areas we're in","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":77.7,"dur":3.71,"text":"Also, we go help the community to evacuate","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":81.42,"dur":3.88,"text":"[guarding the firehouse]-LeBron","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":85.29,"dur":5.46,"text":"sleep and watch movies sometimes we go out, even if its raining","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":90.76,"dur":15.64,"text":"we have to protect ourselves of course, we have to be vigillant but of course we have to work also in Typhoon because we have to make a living also life doesn’t stop even though there’s a Typhoon we have to do our job also","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":111.99,"dur":2.67,"text":"[playing on the phone]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/006.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":114.66,"dur":1.0,"text":"sleep","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":115.66,"dur":1.63,"text":"sleeping","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":117.28,"dur":2.67,"text":"here in the street","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/007.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":119.95,"dur":1.38,"text":"nothing","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/008.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":121.33,"dur":1.63,"text":"stay home","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/009.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":122.96,"dur":3.46,"text":"make an alternative job","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/010.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":131.88,"dur":2.38,"text":"[selling coconuts]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/010.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":134.26,"dur":4.34,"text":"[hang out]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/010.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":138.6,"dur":7.34,"text":"this? for me, it’s normal that rain is normal for me","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/011.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":145.94,"dur":1.75,"text":"the house","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/012.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":147.69,"dur":1.38,"text":"drinking coffee","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/012.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":149.07,"dur":1.17,"text":"also drink coffee","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/012.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":150.23,"dur":1.29,"text":"eating","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/012.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":151.53,"dur":2.0,"text":"sell","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/012.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":153.53,"dur":1.92,"text":"[being 6 foot 7 inches]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/013.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":155.45,"dur":3.84,"text":"I’m in my house take a rest and take sleep","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/013.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":159.28,"dur":6.97,"text":"[hooping with gang]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/013.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"}],"turns":[{"t":8.93,"dur":5.09,"text":"Waiting for passengers Passangers [should wear a] seatbelt","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":14.01,"dur":2.21,"text":"Watching Netflix and...","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.23,"dur":1.58,"text":"drinking alcohol maybe","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":18.81,"dur":2.55,"text":"[biking]","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":21.36,"dur":2.59,"text":"well just last night I just lounged on my bed","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":23.94,"dur":2.46,"text":"Play some music Play with my dog","frame":"4kQZMw-7uWY/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},